"MicroPython implements Python 3.4 and some select features of Python 3.5 "
"and above.  The sections below describe the current status of these "
"features."
msgstr ""
"MicroPython は Python 3.4 と Pythpn 3.5 以上の一部の機能を実装しています。"
"次の章では、これらの機能の現状について説明します。"

#: ../../genrst/index.rst:19
msgid ""
"For the features of Python that are implemented by MicroPython, there are"
" sometimes differences in their behaviour compared to standard Python.  "
"The operations listed in the sections below produce conflicting results "
"in MicroPython when compared to standard Python."
msgstr ""
"MicroPython で実装されている Python の機能については、標準の Python と比較して、"
